@stockUrl = http://localhost:8081
@orderUrl = http://localhost:8082

### 查询库存
GET {{stockUrl}}/stocks/1

### 创建订单：预期 201，并扣减一件库存
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "exception": true
}

### 查询订单：将 1 换成创建订单返回的 id
GET {{orderUrl}}/orders/1

### 库存不足：预期 409，订单回滚
POST {{orderUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2147483647
}